Eligible uses include bus, passenger rail, and specialized transit operations, mobility management, and first/
last-mile connections; and capital investments to maintain, rehabilitate, and modernize public transportation
systems. Eligible capital investments may include transit stations and facilities; passenger rail and bus corridors;
passenger amenities; parking and access improvements; signals and supporting infrastructure; fleet acquisition
