well as tribal lands of the Pechanga Band of Luiseño Indians, the Soboba Band of Luiseño Indians, the Cahuilla
Band of Mission Indians, the Ramona Band of Cahuilla,the Santa Rosa Band of Cahuilla Indians, and the
Morongo Band of Mission Indians.
